<h1>Welcome to Questionnaire </h1>
<p><span class="blue-font"><strong>The Retired and Senior Volunteer Program (Questionnaire) </strong>of Indian River County is sponsored by the Senior Resource Association.  Questionnaire has been providing volunteer opportunities to seniors in our community for 23 years.</span>   <br />
<br />


Questionnaire of Indian River County matches the interests and skills of individuals age 55 and better with the needs of local non-profit organizations.  Questionnaire partners with more than 75 local organizations to offer a wide range of opportunities.  There is a match for anyone with the time, dedication and desire for a meaningful volunteer experience.  Some examples of opportunities include:</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<div class="f-l"><ul class="bodylist">
  <li>After School Tutoring </li>
  <li>Build Homes for Needy Families </li>
  <li>Deliver Meals to Homebound Seniors </li>
  <li>Drive Individuals to Medical Appointments </li>
  <li>Lead Fundraising Efforts </li>
  <li>Assist Local Police Departments </li>
  <li>And much, much, more! </li>
</ul></div>
